{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51555","headline":"咏奸汉 · 归处讷","name":"咏奸汉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻唇利舌傍侯门，送谄承颜日月新。\n爱与大官添弟子，能将小药献夫人。\n秤头不放分毫过，对面常如割骨贫。\n更有一般奸太晒，聚钱唯趁买金银。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归处讷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}